                  <p>
                    The graph is a line segment from <m>(40,50)</m> to <m>(180,85)</m>, also going through the points <m>(80, 60)</m>, <m>(120, 70)</m>, and <m>(160, 80)</m>.
                  </p>
                </description>
              </image>
